Z||000007||LarryB||05-15-2000||05:07 AM||||If you don't want to wait for the right one to show up on eBay you can order a factory manual from Helms, <A HREF="http://www.helm.com," TARGET=_blank>http://www.helm.com,</A>  they cost about $75-$90 new depending on model year you need.<P><BR>||||reg||1
